## CURRENT PHASE: Phase 1 — MVP
Goals:
- Guest session mode only (no auth, no login required yet)
- No data persistence yet (nothing saved to DB in this phase)
- Core app loop must work end to end:
    user craving → Gemini filters → Google Places result → yes/no decision → navigation

What to display on the restaurant card:
- Name
- Photo of the place
- Distance from user
- Price ($/$$/$$$)
- Cuisine type
- Address
- Link to restaurant page
- HAS TO BE OPEN — always pass open_now: true to Google Places

Yes/No loop:
- YES → show navigation options (Apple Maps or Google Maps deep link)
- NO → AI asks follow-up for more specific cravings, then searches again
       If still no match after follow-up → show manual filter failsafe panel

