## DESIGN SYSTEM

Color palette (dark theme only):
- Base background:   #13131A
- Card surface:      #1C1C26
- Border:            #2E2E3E
- Primary accent:    #C4866A  (terracotta/warm)
- Secondary accent:  #7AB88A  (sage green — for positive states)
- Primary text:      #F0EDE8
- Secondary text:    #8A8799
