Design principles:
- Minimal and uncluttered — nothing unnecessary on screen
- Sophisticated, modern — no bright colors, easy on the eyes
- Floating restaurant photo cards on sign-in background
- Bottom sheet / drawer for notifications (Flutter native, not webview iframe)

Screens (all wireframed):
- Sign In / Sign Up
- Home / Chat (personalized greeting: "Hello {NAME}, what are you craving today?")
  - Text input to talk to AI
  - Voice button
  - Quick-pick suggestion chips
- Restaurant Result Card (name, photo, distance, price, cuisine, address, yes/no buttons)
