## PROJECT FILE STRUCTURE CONVENTIONS
lib/
  screens/       → one file per screen (home_screen.dart, restaurant_screen.dart, etc.)
  widgets/       → reusable UI components (restaurant_card.dart, craving_input.dart, etc.)
  services/      → all API and business logic (gemini_service.dart, places_service.dart)
  models/        → data models (restaurant.dart, user_profile.dart)
  core/          → theme, constants, app colors (app_theme.dart, constants.dart)
  main.dart      → entry point and router setup

---

## CODING RULES
- Never hardcode API keys — always load from .env using flutter_dotenv
- Never put business logic inside screen widgets — use services/
- Always pass open_now: true to Google Places — restaurants must be currently open
- Use go_router for all navigation
- All secrets live in .env which is gitignored — never commit it
- Keep each file focused on one responsibility

