## WHAT NOT TO DO
- Never let Gemini output a restaurant name, address, or any display data
- Never use an iframe for notifications — use Flutter bottom sheet or drawer
- Never store API keys in code or commit them to git
- Never build auth or persistence in Phase 1 — that is Phase 1.5
- Never skip the open_now filter — closed restaurants must never be shown
